om:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Affiliates earn a percentage-based commission on net sales (excluding taxes, shipping, discounts, and returns).</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Commissions are tracked through unique affiliate links.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Payments are made monthly via [Payment Method] once the minimum payout threshold of [$XX] is reached.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Fraudulent, canceled, or returned orders are not eligible for commission.</span><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\"></span></p>\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0in;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><hr align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" size=\"0\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000;\">3. Promotional Guidelines</span></b></span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0px;\">\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Affiliates may promote Campus Greek Fit via personal blogs, social media, email (with permission), and websites.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Affiliates <b>may not</b>:</span>\n<ul type=\"circle\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0px;\">\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Use false or misleading claims.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Engage in spamming or unsolicited emails.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Bid on branded keywords such as “Campus Greek Fit” or variations for paid ads.</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\">Misrepresent their relationship with Campus Greek Fit.</span><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\"></span></p>\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0in;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><hr align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" size=\"0\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0in 0in 8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:Jost;\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000;\">4. Intellectual Property &amp; Product Protection</span></b></span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0px;\">\n<li style=\"color:#000000;line-height:normal;margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:8pt;font-size:12pt;font-family:Jost;\"><span style=\"font-family